# Seeds the town gives Nora when she talks to them (Alex, 2026-11-14): one gift each, once she has
# had Wren's tour. With Gran's seed tin and the packets at Builder's Delight, this is how her first
# beds get planted. Every line here is a DRAFT for Alex.

== seeds_giorgio
@trigger talk giorgio
@requires act1_done
@once
@camera giorgio 6
Giorgio (happy): Ah, Ellie's girl! Wait, wait. I keep these for her every autumn.
> He hands her a paper twist from under the counter.
Giorgio (happy): Pumpkin seeds. Grow them big, and I bake you pumpkin bread. That is a promise.
Nora (happy): Deal.
@give pumpkin_seeds 3
> +3 pumpkin seeds

== seeds_barbara
@trigger talk barbara
@requires act1_done
@once
@camera barbara 6
Barbara (neutral): Your gran's turnips were the best on my round. I've some seed spare. Don't tell the post office.
> She digs an envelope out of her bag. Someone has written TURNIPS on it in capitals.
Barbara (wry): Plant them in the morning, they're ready by supper. Quicker than the post.
@give turnip_seeds 4
> +4 turnip seeds

== seeds_lars
@trigger talk lars
@requires act1_done
@once
@camera lars 6
Lars (neutral): You're growing things up at Ellie's? Good. Ground's been idle too long.
> He presses a small cloth bag into her hand.
Lars (neutral): Turnips. Water them and they come on faster. Sheep like the tops.
@give turnip_seeds 4
> +4 turnip seeds
